hello my name is matthias from datatab  and in this video i'd like to show you  how you can easily calculate a linear  regression  online with datatab so first of all  you need to visit datatab.net afterwards  click on the statistics calculator  and because we want to calculate a  regression we need to select  regression if you want to use your own  data  you need to clear this table so click on  clear table  afterwards you can copy your own data  i've prepared a small example so  simply select the data and copy the data  into this table in this example  we have the body weight of a person the  height  the age and the gender and the aim is  to predict the weight based on the  height  the age and the gender so our dependent  variable  is a weight and the independent  variables  are the height the h and the gender  okay let's calculate the linear  regression with data tab  so we can select the dependent variable  and  the independent variables as a dependent  variable  we want to use the weight so we simply  click  on weight as independent variables we  want to use the  height the h and gender  and now we will get the results for the  linear regression  at the top we can see the r square and  the adjusted  square and here we can  see the anova which simply tell us if  our  overall model is significant or not  in this case because it's smaller than  0.05  the model is significant and at the end  we get our coefficients so we get the  unstandardized coefficients  and the standardized coefficients we get  the values here  and there and also we can see  if the coefficients are significant or  not  if you have for example nominal variable  which has  more than two characteristics then  data tab will automatically create the  dummy variables  further at the right side you will get  the scatter diagram  and if you have the premium version data  tab  will check for you all the conditions if  you are able to calculate  a linear regression so  okay i hope you liked this video if you  have questions  simply leave us a comment bye and see  you the next time
 

